      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "(note these data maybe quite old/obsolete):",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Ø  Looking at timing of WTF web service – network traffic in Chrome – looks filesystem read/etc stuff slow.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "o    REDO Response.write() stuff so there is a proxy object – outputstream – which if nothing else – MAPS to calling the existing API. So callers CAN use that stream API instead of Response.write",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "o    Then redo filesystem router code to use Stream::Copy () from the filesystem read file, to the response object)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "o    That MAY help a little – but then put in timing code to see where the time is being spent. At least we can start writing while doing reading. That should help some.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
